      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "AI system prompts are stored in the ai_prompts table so users can edit them via Settings → AI Prompts without code changes. The service falls back to a hardcoded defaultAllocPrompt constant when the DB row is absent or blank."
    },
